{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"deliveries","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue","text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<[","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventRecordV","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord","text":"EventRecord","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]> { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Batches not yet read wait in a buffer of the newest "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"capacity"},{"type":"text","text":" batches; a slower reader"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"misses the older ones, and reads "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination\/records","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for what is kept. The sequence ends once the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destination and every copy of it are gone and every batch kept has been read."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"One task reads the batches at a time; it can fan each one out to the rest of the app. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"first iterator to read holds them until its iteration ends or it is released; a second"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader meanwhile waits its turn, logging a warning once, then reads on from the next batch,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so the first gets every batch in order. A reader cancelled while it waits returns "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Each batch as it is received, whole, for a reader that waits for a delivery: a view that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"refreshes, or a test that reads once a batch arrives.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:12Destinations19InMemoryDestinationV10deliveries11AsyncQueues0F5QueueVySay6Events11EventRecordVGGvp","roleHeading":"Instance Property","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination.swift#L108","fileName":"InMemoryDestination.swift"},"symbolKind":"property","title":"deliveries","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Destinations"}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"deliveries","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV"},{"text":"<[","kind":"text"},{"text":"EventRecord","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventRecordV"},{"text":"]>","kind":"text"}]},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations","doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination"]]},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination\/deliveries","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/destinations\/inmemorydestination\/deliveries"]}],"references":{"doc://AsyncQueues/documentation/AsyncQueues/AsyncQueue":{"abstract":[{"text":"Elements in the order they are enqueued, kept until they are read; one reader at a time reads","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"them.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","title":"AsyncQueue","url":"\/documentation\/asyncqueues\/asyncqueue","identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueu